HB0289 Certificate of need repeal-3.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Geringer, Lawley, Neiman, Singh,
Styvar and Williams and Senator(s) Crum, Kolb,
Rothfuss and Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to public health and safety; authorizing the department of
health to approve alterations or additions to health care facilities for
purposes of health care and life safety compliance determinations only;
repealing bed expansion limitations for nursing care facilities and hospitals
as specified; requiring reports; and providing for an effective date.
